    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABJ5ob4g",
      "title": "eth/076: pin Unichain SystemConfig owner Safe nonce to current + 2",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1585,
      "body": "Requested by Uni: the L1Splitter transfer should run at the Unichain SystemConfig owner Safe (`0x9245d5D10AA8a842B31530De71EA86c0760Ca1b1`) current nonce + 2.\r\n\r\nOrder on that Safe:\r\n1. nonce 11 (current on-chain): SystemConfig owner transfer\r\n2. nonce 12: one more Unichain Safe transaction\r\n3. nonce 13: eth/076 L1Splitter `transferOwnership`\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n- `config.toml`: nonce override 12 → 13\r\n- `VALIDATION.md`: new message hash `0x7b35989283e9278a2ca84f573838fa453a22cd8445390afd5e2e270c422ccb08` and Safe tx hash `0x7e9f90d993b2842f88266b3ce04550460f8c8b9c28be1537e4c6f7307bcefb9d`; domain hash and task calldata unchanged; nonce pre-check and state diff updated",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
